---
const title = 'Terms of Service - findABA.care';
const description = 'Terms of Service for findABA.care - rules and guidelines for using our platform';
---

<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>{title}</title>
  <meta name="description" content={description} />
  <meta name="robots" content="index, follow" />
</head>
<body class="bg-gray-50">
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-12">
    <!-- Header -->
    <div class="mb-8">
      <a href="/" class="text-blue-600 hover:text-blue-700 text-sm font-medium">
        ← Back to findABA.care
      </a>
      <h1 class="mt-4 text-4xl font-bold text-gray-900">Terms of Service</h1>
      <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-gray-600">Last updated: {new Date().toLocaleDateString()}</p>
    </div>

    <!-- Content -->
    <div class="bg-white rounded-lg shadow-sm p-8 space-y-8">
      <section>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-4">Agreement to Terms</h2>
        <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">
          By accessing or using findABA.care ("Service", "Platform", "we", "us", "our"), you agree to be bound by these
          Terms of Service. If you disagree with any part of these terms, you may not access the Service.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-4">Description of Service</h2>
        <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-3">
          findABA.care provides a community discovery platform connecting families with autism-friendly venues, events,
          and resources. Our Service includes:
        </p>
        <ul class="list-disc list-inside text-gray-700 space-y-2 ml-4">
          <li>Venue information and sensory-friendly ratings</li>
          <li>Event listings and RSVP management</li>
          <li>"Go Now" occupancy predictions</li>
          <li>Community reviews and safety reports</li>
          <li>Calendar integration and reminders</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-4">User Accounts</h2>

        <h3 class="text-lg font-medium text-gray-900 mt-6 mb-3">Account Creation</h3>
        <ul class="list-disc list-inside text-gray-700 space-y-2 ml-4">
          <li>You must be at least 18 years old to create an account</li>
          <li>You must provide accurate and complete information</li>
          <li>You are responsible for maintaining the security of your account</li>
          <li>You are responsible for all activities under your account</li>
          <li>You must notify us immediately of any unauthorized access</li>
        </ul>

        <h3 class="text-lg font-medium text-gray-900 mt-6 mb-3">Account Termination</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">
          We reserve the right to suspend or terminate your account if you violate these Terms, engage in fraudulent
          activity, or misuse the Service. You may delete your account at any time from your profile settings.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-4">Acceptable Use</h2>

        <h3 class="text-lg font-medium text-gray-900 mt-6 mb-3">You Agree To:</h3>
        <ul class="list-disc list-inside text-gray-700 space-y-2 ml-4">
          <li>Use the Service lawfully and respectfully</li>
          <li>Provide honest, accurate reviews based on real experiences</li>
          <li>Respect the privacy of other community members</li>
          <li>Report safety concerns and incidents truthfully</li>
          <li>Follow venue rules and event guidelines</li>
        </ul>

        <h3 class="text-lg font-medium text-gray-900 mt-6 mb-3">You Agree NOT To:</h3>
        <ul class="list-disc list-inside text-gray-700 space-y-2 ml-4">
          <li>Post false, misleading, or defamatory content</li>
          <li>Harass, threaten, or discriminate against others</li>
          <li>Share personal information about children (names, photos, identifying details)</li>
          <li>Impersonate others or misrepresent your affiliation</li>
          <li>Spam, solicit, or advertise without permission</li>
          <li>Attempt to hack, disrupt, or reverse engineer the Service</li>
          <li>Scrape or collect data without authorization</li>
          <li>Use the Service for any illegal purpose</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-4">User-Generated Content</h2>

        <h3 class="text-lg font-medium text-gray-900 mt-6 mb-3">Your Content</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-3">
          You retain ownership of content you submit (reviews, ratings, reports). By posting content, you grant
          findABA.care a worldwide, non-exclusive, royalty-free license to:
        </p>
        <ul class="list-disc list-inside text-gray-700 space-y-2 ml-4">
          <li>Display, reproduce, and distribute your content on the Platform</li>
          <li>Modify or adapt content for formatting or technical requirements</li>
          <li>Create aggregate, anonymized reports and analytics</li>
        </ul>

        <h3 class="text-lg font-medium text-gray-900 mt-6 mb-3">Content Moderation</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">
          We review all submitted reviews before publication. We reserve the right to reject, edit, or remove content
          that violates these Terms or community standards. This includes content that is spam, offensive, false, or
          inappropriate.
        </p>

        <h3 class="text-lg font-medium text-gray-900 mt-6 mb-3">Child Safety</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">
          <strong>DO NOT post identifying information about children,</strong> including names, photos, school names,
          or specific medical details. Violations will result in immediate content removal and potential account termination.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-4">Event RSVPs and Attendance</h2>
        <ul class="list-disc list-inside text-gray-700 space-y-2 ml-4">
          <li><strong>RSVPs are commitments</strong> - Please only RSVP if you intend to attend</li>
          <li><strong>Cancellation courtesy</strong> - Cancel your RSVP if plans change to open spots for others</li>
          <li><strong>Capacity limits</strong> - Events have maximum attendance (typically 8-12 people)</li>
          <li><strong>No-show policy</strong> - Repeated no-shows may limit future RSVP privileges</li>
          <li><strong>Host communication</strong> - Respond to host messages and follow event guidelines</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-4">Venue Information</h2>

        <h3 class="text-lg font-medium text-gray-900 mt-6 mb-3">Accuracy and Updates</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">
          We strive to provide accurate, up-to-date venue information. However, venues may change policies, amenities,
          or hours without notice. We verify information periodically but cannot guarantee 100% accuracy. Always confirm
          critical details directly with venues.
        </p>

        <h3 class="text-lg font-medium text-gray-900 mt-6 mb-3">"Go Now" Meter Disclaimer</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">
          Occupancy predictions ("Quiet/Moderate/Busy") are estimates based on time-of-day patterns and are not guaranteed.
          Actual conditions may vary. Use predictions as guidance, not guarantees.
        </p>

        <h3 class="text-lg font-medium text-gray-900 mt-6 mb-3">Report Issues</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">
          If you find inaccurate information or experience issues at a venue, please report it through our incident
          reporting system. We review all reports and update information accordingly.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-4">Disclaimers and Limitations</h2>

        <h3 class="text-lg font-medium text-gray-900 mt-6 mb-3">No Medical or Professional Advice</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">
          findABA.care does not provide medical, therapeutic, educational, or legal advice. Information on our platform
          is for informational purposes only. Consult qualified professionals for medical or therapeutic decisions.
        </p>

        <h3 class="text-lg font-medium text-gray-900 mt-6 mb-3">Community Content</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">
          Reviews and ratings reflect individual experiences and opinions. We do not endorse or verify all claims made
          in user reviews. Use community feedback as one factor in your decisions.
        </p>

        <h3 class="text-lg font-medium text-gray-900 mt-6 mb-3">Third-Party Venues and Events</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">
          findABA.care lists venues and events operated by third parties. We are not responsible for the actions,
          policies, safety, or quality of third-party venues. Always exercise your own judgment and supervise your
          children appropriately.
        </p>

        <h3 class="text-lg font-medium text-gray-900 mt-6 mb-3">Limitation of Liability</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">
          TO THE FULLEST EXTENT PERMITTED BY LAW, findABA.care SHALL NOT BE LIABLE FOR ANY INDIRECT, INCIDENTAL,
          SPECIAL, CONSEQUENTIAL, OR PUNITIVE DAMAGES, OR ANY LOSS OF PROFITS OR REVENUES, WHETHER INCURRED DIRECTLY
          OR INDIRECTLY, OR ANY LOSS OF DATA, USE, GOODWILL, OR OTHER INTANGIBLE LOSSES RESULTING FROM:
        </p>
        <ul class="list-disc list-inside text-gray-700 space-y-2 ml-4 mt-3">
          <li>Your use or inability to use the Service</li>
          <li>Any conduct or content of other users</li>
          <li>Experiences at third-party venues or events</li>
          <li>Unauthorized access to your account</li>
          <li>Errors, bugs, or interruptions in the Service</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-4">Indemnification</h2>
        <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">
          You agree to indemnify and hold harmless findABA.care, its affiliates, and their respective officers,
          directors, employees, and agents from any claims, damages, losses, liabilities, and expenses (including
          legal fees) arising from:
        </p>
        <ul class="list-disc list-inside text-gray-700 space-y-2 ml-4 mt-3">
          <li>Your use of the Service</li>
          <li>Your violation of these Terms</li>
          <li>Your violation of any rights of another party</li>
          <li>Content you submit to the Platform</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-4">Intellectual Property</h2>
        <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">
          The Service, including its design, code, text, graphics, logos, and compilation of content, is owned by
          findABA.care and protected by copyright, trademark, and other intellectual property laws. You may not copy,
          modify, distribute, or create derivative works without our written permission.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-4">Changes to Terms</h2>
        <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">
          We may update these Terms from time to time. We will notify you of significant changes via email or
          prominent notice on the Platform. Your continued use of the Service after changes take effect constitutes
          acceptance of the revised Terms.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-4">Termination</h2>
        <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">
          We may terminate or suspend your account and access to the Service immediately, without prior notice or
          liability, for any reason, including breach of these Terms. Upon termination, your right to use the Service
          will cease immediately.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-4">Governing Law and Disputes</h2>
        <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-3">
          These Terms are governed by the laws of the State of Texas, without regard to conflict of law principles.
          Any disputes arising from these Terms or your use of the Service shall be resolved through binding arbitration
          in Dallas County, Texas, except that either party may seek injunctive relief in court.
        </p>
        <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">
          You waive any right to participate in class action lawsuits or class-wide arbitration.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-4">Severability</h2>
        <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">
          If any provision of these Terms is found to be unenforceable or invalid, that provision will be limited or
          eliminated to the minimum extent necessary, and the remaining provisions will remain in full force and effect.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-4">Contact Us</h2>
        <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-3">
          If you have questions about these Terms of Service, please contact us:
        </p>
        <div class="text-gray-700">
          <p><strong>Email:</strong> <a href="mailto:legal@findabacare.com" class="text-blue-600 hover:text-blue-700">legal@findabacare.com</a></p>
          <p class="mt-2"><strong>Mail:</strong> findABA.care, Legal Department</p>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="border-t border-gray-200 pt-6">
        <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 italic">
          By using findABA.care, you acknowledge that you have read, understood, and agree to be bound by these Terms of Service.
        </p>
      </section>
    </div>

    <!-- Footer -->
    <div class="mt-8 text-center text-sm text-gray-500">
      <p>© {new Date().getFullYear()} findABA.care | <a href="/privacy" class="text-blue-600 hover:text-blue-700">Privacy Policy</a></p>
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
